---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
const roles=[["Senior Engineer, Context Graph","Own the model that links features, requirements, docs and code. Graph databases, static analysis, TypeScript.","Engineering","Full time"],["Applied AI Engineer, Agents","Build the PRD, Brief, Impact and Docs agents and the evaluation harness that keeps them honest.","Engineering","Full time"],["Product Designer","Canvas, Pulse and the review flows where a human accepts what an agent proposed.","Product","Full time"],["Customer Engineer, Pilots","Connect a customer codebase, run the first week, and turn what breaks into the roadmap.","Go to market","Full time"]];
---
<BaseLayout title="Careers | Interfluent" description="Explore open roles at Interfluent and help build the shared context layer between business, product and engineering." canonical="/careers/" active="careers">
<Fragment slot="head"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/pages/careers.css" /></Fragment>
<section class="careers_careers-intro_section is-first-section"><div class="careers_careers-intro_div"><div class="careers_careers-intro_div-2">CAREERS</div><h1 class="careers_careers-intro_h1">Work on the part in between.</h1><p class="careers_careers-intro_p">Small team, weekly releases. You'll ship things that real pilot customers use the same week. Every role talks to customers.</p></div></section>
<section class="careers_careers-roles_section"><div class="careers_careers-roles_div"><div class="careers_careers-roles_div-2">OPEN ROLES · {String(roles.length).padStart(2,"0")}</div><div class="careers_careers-roles_div-3">All roles are full time, hybrid.</div></div><div class="careers_careers-roles_div-4">{roles.map(([t,d,team,type])=><a class="rs-rolerow careers_careers-roles_a" href="/contact/"><div><div class="careers_careers-roles_div-5">{t}</div><div class="careers_careers-roles_div-6">{d}</div></div><div class="careers_careers-roles_div-7">{team}</div><div class="careers_careers-roles_div-8">{type}</div><div class="careers_careers-roles_div-9">Apply →</div></a>)}</div><p class="careers_careers-roles_p">Nothing fits but you've read this far? <a href="/contact/" class="careers_careers-roles_a-2">Write to us anyway.</a></p></section>
<section class="careers_careers-how-we-work_section"><div class="careers_careers-how-we-work_div"><div><div class="careers_careers-how-we-work_div-2">01</div><div class="careers_careers-how-we-work_div-3">We use Interfluent to build Interfluent.</div><p class="careers_careers-how-we-work_p">Our own PRDs, briefs and docs live in the model. If it hurts us, it gets fixed.</p></div><div><div class="careers_careers-how-we-work_div-4">02</div><div class="careers_careers-how-we-work_div-5">Pilots over pitch decks.</div><p class="careers_careers-how-we-work_p-2">Every feature is proven on a customer's real codebase before it's on the website.</p></div><div><div class="careers_careers-how-we-work_div-6">03</div><div class="careers_careers-how-we-work_div-7">Write it down.</div><p class="careers_careers-how-we-work_p-3">Decisions are documents, reviewed as diffs. Meetings are for disagreeing, not for informing.</p></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
